    "Revised builder properly stops short of closing the top-down performance hypothesis; only immediate editing is unsupported.",
    "Revised builder distinguishes fixed pass-profile settling from explicit census queue settlement and actual renderer evidence from aggregate checks.",
    "Latest builder reconciles evidence-producing pass-profiler 80de397… versus current 7d364db…. Independently reconstructing the prior hash by replacing only the human-readable method string matches exactly; sampled behavior is unchanged. Use implemented camera-flight plus fixed30-frame wait, not the original method-string overstatement."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Census reads copied LOD1 outputs and the same owner histogram after a forced owner update; it does not independently enumerate every omitted source bucket or prove selector completeness.",
    "Submitted/active mean buffer entries and iFade-enabled entries, not individually visible pixels. Species maps aggregate retained source ordering; per-entry species/fade arrays are not saved, so the critic independently reconstructs active totals by source offset/hash but can only cross-check per-species active aggregates.",
    "Chunk spheres drive frustum admission, then bucket centers drive selector distance and chunk centers drive the 120m shadow rule. An admitted tree is not necessarily in the viewport; CAP1=520 excludes the deliberate top-down path.",
    "Census-v2 explicitly waits for camera flight and queue, then forces one complete current-camera update. This changes disposable LOD buffers/hysteresis state; it is not an untouched ordinary-frame measurement.",
    "Pass profiler waits for camera flight then 30 frames, not an explicit queue-empty assertion; exact same-page pre/post selector/cast identity is not recorded for each timed block. Its 247-instance inventory and exact submission deltas agree with the separate street census.",
    "The pass aggregate gate checks nonempty matched inventory, stable>=2, and errors; it does not enforce renderer/framebuffer identity, requested mode count or nonempty modes. Actual retained rows separately verify Metal/1920x1080 and all three requested modes.",
    "Color mode disables LOD1 shadows in both controls and hides LOD1 for B. This includes geometry, depth, shading and dependent screen effects, not pure fragment-shader cost. Shadow and color timings are non-additive across fresh pages and different baselines.",
    "Adjacent pairs share controls; fixed order, short durations, headless capture behavior and uncapped policy limit inference. Stable endpoint drift is not a confidence interval or evidence of sustained FPS.",
    "Failed interchange timing cannot replicate settled top-down gains. No-shadow casting is established for the captured top-down presets, not every possible top-down position.",
    "Current local source hashes and source inspection verify scope, but routed transformed response bytes and run-specific complete source manifests are not retained. Diagnostic exposure uses internal owner state only in disposable pages.",
    "No screenshot, subjective quality, build rerun, API/save/restage, moving-transition, forced-GC memory or official whole-game performance gate is established by this audit. The builder reports a 163-module build; the four supplied JSON files contain no retained build log."
  ],
